WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.229 --> 00:00:05.110
This concludes the 203.03 atmospheric lighting course

2
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.910
for Unreal Engine 5.6.

3
00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:09.650
In this course, we explored the fundamentals

4
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.789
of working with and manipulating volumetric fog.

5
00:00:12.789 --> 00:00:16.469
We also covered how to utilize god rays, fog cards,

6
00:00:16.469 --> 00:00:18.309
and implement localized fog volumes

7
00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:20.780
to add depth to our level.

8
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:24.000
We briefly covered the basics of using a post-processing volume

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.320
and creating a basic post-processing material that

10
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.519
could be added to a post-processing volume

11
00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:32.679
for further artistic effect and control.

12
00:00:32.679 --> 00:00:35.640
Finally, we wrapped up the class with a few hands-on examples

13
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.159
of lighting an interior scene, and we briefly

14
00:00:38.159 --> 00:00:41.100
covered the key concepts for using megalites.

15
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.960
Thanks for watching.
